[63.372314, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m3\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[63.372625, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe partial proof has two `admit`s. I’ll replace the base case with a rewrite using `plus_n_O` and the inductive step with `plus_n_Sm` plus the induction \r\nhypothesis.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncat > plus_comm.v <<'EOF'\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\n\r\nTheorem plus_comm : forall n m : nat,\r\n  n + m = m + n.\r\nProof.\r\n  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [| n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite <- plus_n_O.\r\n    reflexivity.\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite plus_n_Sm.\r\n    rewrite IHn'.\r\n    reflexivity.\r\nQed.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqc plus_comm.v\r\nls -l plus_comm.v plus_comm.vo\r\ncoqchk -Q . '' plus_comm 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
