[69.295238, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe inductive-step rewrite failed because `simpl` reduced the goal in a way that no longer contains the expected syntactic subterm. I’ll inspect the exact \r\nintermediate goals and adjust the proof accordingly.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncat > /tmp/inspect.v <<'EOF'\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\nTheorem plus_comm_test : forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n.\r\nProof.\r\n  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [| n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl. Show.\r\nAbort.\r\nTheorem plus_comm_test2 : forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n.\r\nProof.\r\n  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [| n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl. rewrite <- plus_n_O. reflexivity.\r\n  - simpl. Show.\r\nAbort.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqtop -quiet < /tmp/inspect.v 2>&1 | sed -n '1,120p'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
