[69.595468, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nWelcome to Coq 8.18.0\r\n\r\nCoq < [Loading ML file ring_plugin.cmxs (using legacy method) ... done]\r\n\r\nCoq < 1 goal\r\n  \r\n  ============================\r\n  forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n\r\n\r\nplus_comm_test < \r\nplus_comm_test < 1 goal\r\n  \r\n  n, m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  n + m = m + n\r\n\r\nplus_comm_test < 2 goals\r\n  \r\n  m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  0 + m = m + 0\r\n\r\ngoal 2 is:\r\n S n' + m = m + S n'\r\n\r\nplus_comm_test < 1 goal\r\n  \r\n  m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  0 + m = m + 0\r\n\r\n1 goal\r\n  \r\n  m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  m = m + 0\r\n\r\n1 goal\r\n  \r\n  m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  m = m + 0\r\n\r\nplus_comm_test < \r\nCoq < 1 goal\r\n  \r\n  ============================\r\n  forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n\r\n\r\nplus_comm_test2 < \r\nplus_comm_test2 < 1 goal\r\n  \r\n  n, m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  n + m = m + n\r\n\r\nplus_comm_test2 < 2 goals\r\n  \r\n  m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  0 + m = m + 0\r\n\r\ngoal 2 is:\r\n S n' + m = m + S n'\r\n\r\nplus_comm_test2 < 1 goal\r\n  \r\n  m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  0 + m = m + 0\r\n\r\n1 goal\r\n  \r\n  m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  m = m + 0\r\n\r\n1 goal\r\n  \r\n  m : nat\r\n  ============================\r\n  m = m\r\n\r\nThis subproof is complete, but there are some unfocused goals.\r\nFocus next goal with bullet -.\r\n\r\n1 goal\r\n\r\ngoal 1 is:\r\n S n' + m = m + S n'\r\n\r\nplus_comm_test2 < 1 goal\r\n  \r\n  n', m : nat\r\n  IHn' : n' + m = m + n'\r\n  ============================\r\n  S n' + m = m + S n'\r\n\r\n1 goal\r\n  \r\n  n', m : nat\r\n  IHn' : n' + m = m + n'\r\n  ============================\r\n  S (n' + m) = m + S n'\r\n\r\n1 goal\r\n  \r\n  n', m : nat\r\n  IHn' : n' + m = m + n'\r\n  ============================\r\n  S (n' + m) = m + S n'