[75.211032, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncat > /tmp/inspect2.v <<'EOF'\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\nTheorem plus_comm_test3 : forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n.\r\nProof.\r\n  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [| n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl. rewrite <- plus_n_O. reflexivity.\r\n  - simpl. Show.\r\n    rewrite plus_n_Sm. Show.\r\n    rewrite IHn'.\r\nAbort.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqtop -quiet < /tmp/inspect2.v 2>&1 | sed -n '1,160p'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
