[81.481142, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncat > /tmp/check.v <<'EOF'\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\nCheck plus_n_Sm.\r\nCheck plus_Sn_m.\r\nCheck Nat.add_succ_r.\r\nCheck Nat.add_succ_l.\r\nCheck plus_n_O.\r\nCheck Nat.add_0_r.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqtop -quiet < /tmp/check.v 2>&1 | sed -n '1,120p'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
