[88.664244, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m7\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[88.664669, "o", "\r\u001b[2K`plus_n_Sm` in Coq 8.18 is oriented as `S (n + m) = n + S m`, so the rewrite must be reversed. I’ll update it and recompile.\r\n\r\n```\r\nsed -i 's/rewrite plus_n_Sm\\./rewrite <- plus_n_Sm./' plus_comm.v\r\nnl -ba plus_comm.v\r\nrm -f plus_comm.vo plus_comm.glob plus_comm.vos plus_comm.vok\r\ncoqc plus_comm.v\r\nls -l plus_comm.vo\r\ncat > /tmp/check_plus_comm.v <<'EOF'\r\nRequire Import plus_comm.\r\nCheck plus_comm.\r\nPrint Assumptions plus_comm.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqc -Q . '' /tmp/check_plus_comm.v\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[88.665894, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[88.990294, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[88.990474, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n     1  Require Import Arith.\r\n     2  \r\n     3  Theorem plus_comm : forall n m : nat,\r\n     4    n + m = m + n.\r\n     5  Proof.\r\n     6    intros n m.\r\n     7    induction n as [| n' IHn'].\r\n     8    - simpl.\r\n     9      rewrite <- plus_n_O.\r\n    10      reflexivity.\r\n    11    - simpl.\r\n    12      rewrite <- plus_n_Sm.\r\n    13      rewrite IHn'.\r\n    14      reflexivity.\r\n    15  Qed.\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 14509 Nov  1 07:50 plus_comm.vo\r\nplus_comm\r\n     : forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n\r\nClosed under the global context\r\n\r\n"]
[88.99134, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
